            <div xml:id="d622">

                <pb facs="0876" n="762" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg762"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1422: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-10T22:00:00-05:00">October 10, 1931—10
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>334. Reference my 331 [<hi rendition="#italic">333</hi>] of today’s date,<anchor
                        n="94" xml:id="d622-f1"/> Foreign Minister has just informed me he is
                    instructing Peruvian Ambassador Washington to vigorously cooperate in every
                    possible way with the Department towards settling Chaco situation. He states
                    that on occasion of first of recent clashes he instructed Peruvian Ministers in
                    La Paz and Asunción to work for harmony and in interest of November meeting and
                    noncreation [<hi rendition="#italic">nonaggression?</hi>] pact and that he
                    ascertained that Chilean Government would take the same line. He is tonight
                    telegraphing Peruvian diplomatic representatives in Brazil <pb facs="0877"
                        n="763" xml:id="pg763"/> and the Argentine to assist the issue in every way
                    they can and is sending additional messages to the Peruvian diplomatic
                    representatives in Chile, Bolivia, and Paraguay. The Foreign Minister intends
                    Peruvian cooperation shall be complete.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
